name pdfextra
category Package
revision 61719
shortdesc Extra PDF features for (Op)TeX
longdesc This package provides extra PDF features for OpTeX (or in
longdesc limited form for plain LuaTeX and LuaLaTeX). As a minimalistic
longdesc format, OpTeX does not support "advanced" features of the PDF
longdesc file format in its base. This third party package aims to
longdesc provide them. Summary of supported features: insertion of
longdesc multimedia (audio, video, 3D), hyperlinks and other actions,
longdesc triggering events, transitions, attachments.
